f=\"https://studiobagno.com.au/collection-organic\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Collection Organic</a>. This elegant addition to your contemporary bathroom mirrors the trademark curve of the Nur range and is available in both gloss white and semi-gloss white, The aesthetic continuity extends seamlessly, creating a captivating 'floating' appearance with its subtle underskirt. Crafted from MarmoTech, the 'Nur Bath' is not only a visual delight but also a sensory one. It quickly warms to the touch and efficiently retains heat, ensuring a luxurious bathing experience every time. Redefine relaxation with the Nur Bath from Studio Bagno. </div><div><div><b>Made with MarmoTech</b></div><div>Constructed from a formulation of premium stone composite materials and 100% silica free, each bath undergoes a meticulous process, ensuring the highest standards of quality and durability. The result is a freestanding bath with a luxurious tactile finish, that not only feels exquisite but also warms quickly and helps maintains water temperature.</div></div><div><b>Notes:</b></div><div>-Overflow &amp; waste included<br/></div><div>-Plug &amp; Waste included as standard with bath: <a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw009-mw\"><b>SBW009/MW</b></a></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
